details__image__container\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"film-details__image\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/film_images/437617.d.jpg?cb=1743418934\" alt=\"Image for Mr Burton\"><div class=\"film-details__image__overlay\"></div></div><div class=\"film-details__inner alignwide\"><div class=\"film-details__top\"><div class=\"film-details__top__left\"><h3>Browse</h3><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/quartet-intro/\" class=\"film-details__browse-previous\" title=\"Previous\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/disneys-snow-white/\" class=\"film-details__browse-next\" title=\"Next\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"film-details__top__content\"><h1 class=\"film-details__title\">Mr Burton<span class=\"film-details__rating\">12A</span></h1><div class=\"film-details__buttons chiswick-buttons\"><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-primary\" href=\"#book\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-down\"></i><span>Book Tickets</span></a><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-secondary\" data-lity=\"1\" data-action=\"play-trailer\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h6Trx84-gy4\"><i class=\"fal fa-play\"></i><span>Play Trailer</span></a></div><div class=\"film-details__synopsis\">Based on a remarkable true story, discover how the poor son of a miner became one of the greatest actors the world has ever known, with the help of an unlikely mentor.<br />\n<br />\nIn the Welsh town of Port Talbot, 1942, Richard Jenkins (Harry Lawtey) lives as a wayward schoolboy, caught between the pressures of his struggling family, a devastating war, and his own ambitions. However, a new opportunity arises when Richard’s natural talent for drama catches the attention of his teacher, Philip Burton (BAFTA winner Toby Jones).<br />\n<br />\nTaking Richard under his wing, the young man thrives thanks to Philip’s strict tutelage and the guidance of kindly landlady, Ma Smith (Academy Award nominee Lesley Manville). However, as the acting world comes within Richard’s reach, the burden of his past risks holding him back forever.</div><div class=\"film-details__cast\"><h3 class=\"film-details__cast__header\">Cast</h3><div class=\"film-details__cast__list\">Toby Jones • Lesley Manville • Aneurin Barnard • Hannah New • Aimee-Ffion Edwards</div></div><div class=\"film-details__director-runtime\"><div class=\"film-details__director\"><h3 class=\"film-details__director__header\">Director</h3><div class=\"film-details__director__list\">Marc Evans</div></div><div class=\"film-details__running-time\"><h3 class=\"film-details__running-time__header\">Running Time</h3><div class=\"film-details__running-time__content\">124 minutes\n                            </div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__rating-description\"><div class=\"film-details__rating-description__content\">infrequent strong language, discrimination</div></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets\" id=\"book\"><h2 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__title\">Book Tickets</h2><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__inner\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro__content\">Platinum Members get priority booking &#8211; please <a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"615\">sign in</a> to access. <br><br>Public booking opens every Tuesday for the subsequent Friday to Thursday.</div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content\"><h3 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content__title\">Mr Burton<span class=\"film-details__rating\">12A</span></h3><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Mon 07 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"14:50\" data-id=\"437722\" href=\"/tickets/437722\"><span>14:50</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:50\" data-id=\"437727\" href=\"/tickets/437727\"><span>17:50</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:20\" data-id=\"437729\" href=\"/tickets/437729\"><span>20:20</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Tue 08 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"11:00\" data-id=\"437732\" href=\"/tickets/437732\"><span>11:00</span><span data-tag=\"Parent &amp; Baby\">Parent &#038; Baby</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"14:20\" data-id=\"437736\" href=\"/tickets/437736\"><span>14:20</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:30\" data-id=\"437739\" href=\"/tickets/437739\"><span>17:30</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:30\" data-id=\"437742\" href=\"/tickets/437742\"><span>20:30</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Wed 09 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"11:10\" data-id=\"437746\" href=\"/tickets/437746\"><span>11:10</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"14:20\" data-id=\"437749\" href=\"/tickets/437749\"><span>14:20</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:30\" data-id=\"437753\" href=\"/tickets/437753\"><span>17:30</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:30\" data-id=\"437759\" href=\"/tickets/437759\"><span>20:30</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Thu 10 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"11:50\" data-id=\"437761\" href=\"/tickets/437761\"><span>11:50</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"14:00\" data-id=\"437764\" href=\"/tickets/437764\"><span>14:00</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:00\" data-id=\"437768\" href=\"/tickets/437768\"><span>17:00</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:00\" data-id=\"437772\" href=\"/tickets/437772\"><span>20:00</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><script>\n                                jQuery(function($) {\n\n                                    var items = [];\n                                    var idx = 1;\n                                    var title = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__title')[0].textContent;\n                                    var days = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day');\n                                    for(var i=0;i<days.length;i++) {\n                                        var day = days[i];\n                                        var screenings = day.getElementsByClassName('book__link');\n                                        for(var screeningIdx=0;screeningIdx<screenings.length;screeningIdx++) {\n                                            var screening = screenings[screeningIdx];\n                                            var tags = screening.getElementsByTagName('span');\n                                            var ic = [];\n                                            for(var tagIndex=1;tagIndex<tags.length;tagIndex++) {\n                                                ic.push(tags[tagIndex].textContent);\n                                            }\n                                            items.push({\n                                                item_id:screening.getAttribute('data-id'),\n                                                item_name:title,\n                                                index:idx++,\n                                                item_category:screening.getAttribute('data-time'),\n                                                item_category2:ic.join('|'),\n                                                item_category4:screening.title?screening.title:undefined\n                                            });\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    window.dataLayer.push({\n                                        event:'view_item_list',\n                                        ecommerce:{\n                                            items:items\n                                        }\n                                    });\n                                })\n                            </script></div></div></div></div> \n\n<section class=\"chiswick__newsletter\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Newsletter-Desktop-BG2.jpg)\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__inner\"><h3>Subscribe to our newsletter</h3><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout__content\"><p>Stay up to date with all the latest cinema news, including updates, membership news and more.</p></div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__form__wrapper\"><a href=\"/newsletter-signup/\">Your email address...</a></div></div><div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__privacy__wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/privacy-policy/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"1048\">Read privacy policy</a></div></div></div></section>\t\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n  <div id=\"inner-footer\" class=\"wrap cf\">\n    <div id=\"media_image-4\" class=\"widget-odd widget-first widget-1 logo-footer widget widget_media_image\"><h4 class=\"widgettitle\">The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema</h4><a href=\"/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png\" class=\"image wp-image-1947  attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png 300w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1024x282.png 1024w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-768x212.png 768w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1600x441.png 1600w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1536x424.png 1536w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-2048x565.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></div><div id=\"nav_menu-3\" class=\"widget-even widget-2 widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-footer-left-container\"><ul id=\"menu-footer-left\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-1045\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1045\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/gift-membership/\">Gift membership</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1046\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1046\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/redeem/\">Redeem a gift</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1047\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-1047\"><a href=\"/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-213541\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-213541\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/contact/\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul></div></div><div id=\"nav_menu-4\" class=\"widget-odd widget-3 widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-footer-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-footer-right\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-1043\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1043\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/faq/\">Frequently asked questions</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1041\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1041\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/terms-and-conditions/\">Terms &#038; conditions</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1050\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-privacy-policy menu-item-1050\"><a rel=\"privacy-policy\" href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/privacy-policy/\">Privacy policy</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-213542\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-213542\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/cookie-policy/\">Cookie policy</a></li>\n</ul></div></div><div id=\"nav_menu-5\" class=\"widget-even widget-last widget-4 widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-follow-us-container\"><ul id=\"menu-follow-us-1\" class=\"menu\"><li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-622\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/chiswickcinema/\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Instagram</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-623\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ChiswickCinema\"><i class=\"fab fa-twitter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Twitter</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-624\"><a target=