__image__container\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"film-details__image\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/chiswick/library/images/no-film-image.jpg\" alt=\"Image for Parasite\"><div class=\"film-details__image__overlay\"></div></div><div class=\"film-details__inner alignwide\"><div class=\"film-details__top\"><div class=\"film-details__top__left\"><h3>Browse</h3><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/black-bag/\" class=\"film-details__browse-previous\" title=\"Previous\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/flow/\" class=\"film-details__browse-next\" title=\"Next\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"film-details__top__content\"><h1 class=\"film-details__title\">Parasite<span class=\"film-details__rating\">15</span></h1><div class=\"film-details__buttons chiswick-buttons\"><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-primary\" href=\"#book\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-down\"></i><span>Book Tickets</span></a><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-secondary\" data-lity=\"1\" data-action=\"play-trailer\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tBfgTZsBeFM\"><i class=\"fal fa-play\"></i><span>Play Trailer</span></a></div><div class=\"film-details__synopsis\">Winner of the 2020 Oscar for Best Picture, Best Director, Best Original Screenplay and Best International Film, the 2020 BAFTA for Best Film Not in the English Language and Best Original Screenplay, and the Palme d&#8217;Or at the 2019 Cannes Film Festival. Bong Joon-ho (&#8216;Snowpiercer&#8217; &#8216;Okja&#8217;) returns with this black comedy about wealth, greed and class discrimination. Kim Ki-teak&#8217;s (Song Kang-ho) family are all unemployed and living in a squalid basement. When his son gets a tutoring job at the lavish home of the Park family, the Kim family&#8217;s luck changes. One by one they gradually infiltrate the wealthy Park&#8217;s home, attempting to take over their affluent lifestyle.</div><div class=\"film-details__cast\"><h3 class=\"film-details__cast__header\">Cast</h3><div class=\"film-details__cast__list\">Kang-ho Song • Woo-sik Choi • Sun-kyun Lee • Yeo-Jeong Cho • Hyae Jin Chang • So-dam Park</div></div><div class=\"film-details__director-runtime\"><div class=\"film-details__director\"><h3 class=\"film-details__director__header\">Director</h3><div class=\"film-details__director__list\">Joon-ho Bong</div></div><div class=\"film-details__running-time\"><h3 class=\"film-details__running-time__header\">Running Time</h3><div class=\"film-details__running-time__content\">132 minutes\n                            </div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__rating-description\"><div class=\"film-details__rating-description__content\">strong bloody violence, language, sex, sex references</div></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets\" id=\"book\"><h2 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__title\">Book Tickets</h2><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__inner\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro__content\">Platinum Members get priority booking &#8211; please <a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"615\">sign in</a> to access. <br><br>Public booking opens every Tuesday for the subsequent Friday to Thursday.</div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content\"><h3 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content__title\">Parasite<span class=\"film-details__rating\">15</span></h3><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Mon 07 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:30\" data-id=\"414358\" href=\"/tickets/414358\"><span>20:30</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Tue 08 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:40\" data-id=\"414359\" href=\"/tickets/414359\"><span>17:40</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><script>\n                                jQuery(function($) {\n\n                                    var items = [];\n                                    var idx = 1;\n                                    var title = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__title')[0].textContent;\n                                    var days = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day');\n                                    for(var i=0;i<days.length;i++) {\n                                        var day = days[i];\n                                        var screenings = day.getElementsByClassName('book__link');\n                                        for(var screeningIdx=0;screeningIdx<screenings.length;screeningIdx++) {\n                                            var screening = screenings[screeningIdx];\n                                            var tags = screening.getElementsByTagName('span');\n                                            var ic = [];\n                                            for(var tagIndex=1;tagIndex<tags.length;tagIndex++) {\n                                                ic.push(tags[tagIndex].textContent);\n                                            }\n                                            items.push({\n                                                item_id:screening.getAttribute('data-id'),\n                                                item_name:title,\n                                                index:idx++,\n                                                item_category:screening.getAttribute('data-time'),\n                                                item_category2:ic.join('|'),\n                                                item_category4:screening.title?screening.title:undefined\n                                            });\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    window.dataLayer.push({\n                                        event:'view_item_list',\n                                        ecommerce:{\n                                            items:items\n                                        }\n                                    });\n                                })\n                            </script></div></div></div></div> \n\n<section class=\"chiswick__newsletter\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Newsletter-Desktop-BG2.jpg)\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__inner\"><h3>Subscribe to our newsletter</h3><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout__content\"><p>Stay up to date with all the latest cinema news, including updates, membership news and more.</p></div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__form__wrapper\"><a href=\"/newsletter-signup/\">Your email address...</a></div></div><div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__privacy__wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/privacy-policy/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"1048\">Read privacy policy</a></div></div></div></section>\t\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n  <div id=\"inner-footer\" class=\"wrap cf\">\n    <div id=\"media_image-4\" class=\"widget-odd widget-first widget-1 logo-footer widget widget_media_image\"><h4 class=\"widgettitle\">The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema</h4><a href=\"/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png\" class=\"image wp-image-1947  attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: