menu-item-object-page menu-item-2240\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/gift-shop/\">Gift shop</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-has-children menu-item-2359\"><a href=\"#\">Membership</a>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-212594\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/become-a-member/\">Become a Member</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2358\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/gift-membership/\">Gift membership</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2111\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/private-hire/\">Private hire</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-412128\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/advertise-with-us/\">Advertise with us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-2356\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/faq/\">FAQ</a></li>\n</ul></div></div><div id=\"nav_menu-6\" class=\"widget-even widget-last widget-2 widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-sub-header-right-container\"><ul id=\"menu-sub-header-right\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-3256\" class=\"header-search-button menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-3256\"><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"far fa-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Search</span></a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-4432\" class=\"my-sign-in menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4432\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\"><i class=\"far fa-user-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Sign in</span></a></li>\n</ul></div></div>    </div>\n  </section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"content\">\n\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"film-details\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"film-details__image__container\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"film-details__image\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/film_images/437791.d.jpg?cb=1743516132\" alt=\"Image for Warfare\"><div class=\"film-details__image__overlay\"></div></div><div class=\"film-details__inner alignwide\"><div class=\"film-details__top\"><div class=\"film-details__top__left\"><h3>Browse</h3><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/members-preview-the-penguin-lessons/\" class=\"film-details__browse-previous\" title=\"Previous\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/shrek/\" class=\"film-details__browse-next\" title=\"Next\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"film-details__top__content\"><h1 class=\"film-details__title\">Warfare<span class=\"film-details__rating\">15</span></h1><div class=\"film-details__buttons chiswick-buttons\"><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-primary\" href=\"#book\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-down\"></i><span>Book Tickets</span></a></div><div class=\"film-details__synopsis\">Written and directed by Iraq War veteran Ray Mendoza and Alex Garland (Civil War, 28 Days Later), Warfare embeds audiences with a platoon of American Navy SEALs on a surveillance mission gone wrong in insurgent territory. A visceral, boots-on-the-ground story of modern warfare and brotherhood, told like never before: in real time and based on the memory of the people who lived it.</div><div class=\"film-details__cast\"><h3 class=\"film-details__cast__header\">Cast</h3><div class=\"film-details__cast__list\">Joseph Quinn • Kit Connor • Cosmo Jarvis • D&#8217;Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai • Will Poulter • Charles Melton • Finn Bennett • Noah Centineo</div></div><div class=\"film-details__director-runtime\"><div class=\"film-details__director\"><h3 class=\"film-details__director__header\">Director</h3><div class=\"film-details__director__list\">Alex Garland • Ray Mendoza</div></div><div class=\"film-details__running-time\"><h3 class=\"film-details__running-time__header\">Running Time</h3><div class=\"film-details__running-time__content\">96 minutes\n                            </div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__rating-description\"><div class=\"film-details__rating-description__content\">strong injury detail, violence, language</div></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets\" id=\"book\"><h2 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__title\">Book Tickets</h2><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__inner\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro__content\">Platinum Members get priority booking &#8211; please <a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"615\">sign in</a> to access. <br><br>Public booking opens every Tuesday for the subsequent Friday to Thursday.</div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content\"><h3 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content__title\">Warfare<span class=\"film-details__rating\">15</span></h3><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Thu 17 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:55\" data-id=\"437782\" href=\"/tickets/437782\"><span>20:55</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Fri 18 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"13:10\" data-id=\"437783\" href=\"/tickets/437783\"><span>13:10</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"15:45\" data-id=\"437784\" href=\"/tickets/437784\"><span>15:45</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"18:20\" data-id=\"437785\" href=\"/tickets/437785\"><span>18:20</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:50\" data-id=\"437786\" href=\"/tickets/437786\"><span>20:50</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Sat 19 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"13:15\" data-id=\"437787\" href=\"/tickets/437787\"><span>13:15</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"15:50\" data-id=\"437788\" href=\"/tickets/437788\"><span>15:50</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"18:25\" data-id=\"437789\" href=\"/tickets/437789\"><span>18:25</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:55\" data-id=\"437790\" href=\"/tickets/437790\"><span>20:55</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Sun 20 Apr</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"12:40\" data-id=\"437794\" href=\"/tickets/437794\"><span>12:40</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"15:15\" data-id=\"437795\" href=\"/tickets/437795\"><span>15:15</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"17:50\" data-id=\"437796\" href=\"/tickets/437796\"><span>17:50</span></a></div><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"20:20\" data-id=\"437797\" href=\"/tickets/437797\"><span>20:20</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Mon 2