 data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"film-details__image__container\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"film-details__image\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/film_images/58292.d.jpg?cb=1663154748\" alt=\"Image for Shrek the Third\"><div class=\"film-details__image__overlay\"></div></div><div class=\"film-details__inner alignwide\"><div class=\"film-details__top\"><div class=\"film-details__top__left\"><h3>Browse</h3><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/bonnie-and-clyde-the-musical/\" class=\"film-details__browse-previous\" title=\"Previous\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/slaves-of-new-york-intro/\" class=\"film-details__browse-next\" title=\"Next\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"film-details__top__content\"><h1 class=\"film-details__title\">Shrek the Third<span class=\"film-details__rating\">U</span></h1><div class=\"film-details__buttons chiswick-buttons\"><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-primary\" href=\"#book\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-down\"></i><span>Book Tickets</span></a><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-secondary\" data-lity=\"1\" data-action=\"play-trailer\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_MoIr7811Bs\"><i class=\"fal fa-play\"></i><span>Play Trailer</span></a></div><div class=\"film-details__synopsis\">When his new father-in-law, King Harold falls ill, Shrek is looked at as the heir to the land of Far, Far Away. Not one to give up his beloved swamp, Shrek recruits his friends Donkey and Puss in Boots to install the rebellious Artie as the new king. Princess Fiona, however, rallies a band of royal girlfriends to fend off a coup d&#8217;etat by the jilted Prince Charming.</div><div class=\"film-details__cast\"><h3 class=\"film-details__cast__header\">Cast</h3><div class=\"film-details__cast__list\">Mike Myers • Cameron Diaz • Eddie Murphy</div></div><div class=\"film-details__director-runtime\"><div class=\"film-details__director\"><h3 class=\"film-details__director__header\">Director</h3><div class=\"film-details__director__list\">Chris Miller • Raman Hui</div></div><div class=\"film-details__running-time\"><h3 class=\"film-details__running-time__header\">Running Time</h3><div class=\"film-details__running-time__content\">93 minutes\n                            </div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__rating-description\"><div class=\"film-details__rating-description__content\">Contains mild language and comic fight scenes</div></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets\" id=\"book\"><h2 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__title\">Book Tickets</h2><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__inner\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro__content\">Platinum Members get priority booking &#8211; please <a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"615\">sign in</a> to access. <br><br>Public booking opens every Tuesday for the subsequent Friday to Thursday.</div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content\"><h3 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content__title\">Shrek the Third<span class=\"film-details__rating\">U</span></h3><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Sat 03 May</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"10:30\" data-id=\"437623\" href=\"/tickets/437623\"><span>10:30</span><span data-tag=\"Kids Club\">Kids Club</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Sun 04 May</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"10:00\" data-id=\"437624\" href=\"/tickets/437624\"><span>10:00</span><span data-tag=\"Kids Club\">Kids Club</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><script>\n                                jQuery(function($) {\n\n                                    var items = [];\n                                    var idx = 1;\n                                    var title = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__title')[0].textContent;\n                                    var days = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day');\n                                    for(var i=0;i<days.length;i++) {\n                                        var day = days[i];\n                                        var screenings = day.getElementsByClassName('book__link');\n                                        for(var screeningIdx=0;screeningIdx<screenings.length;screeningIdx++) {\n                                            var screening = screenings[screeningIdx];\n                                            var tags = screening.getElementsByTagName('span');\n                                            var ic = [];\n                                            for(var tagIndex=1;tagIndex<tags.length;tagIndex++) {\n                                                ic.push(tags[tagIndex].textContent);\n                                            }\n                                            items.push({\n                                                item_id:screening.getAttribute('data-id'),\n                                                item_name:title,\n                                                index:idx++,\n                                                item_category:screening.getAttribute('data-time'),\n                                                item_category2:ic.join('|'),\n                                                item_category4:screening.title?screening.title:undefined\n                                            });\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    window.dataLayer.push({\n                                        event:'view_item_list',\n                                        ecommerce:{\n                                            items:items\n                                        }\n                                    });\n                                })\n                            </script></div></div></div></div> \n\n<section class=\"chiswick__newsletter\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Newsletter-Desktop-BG2.jpg)\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__inner\"><h3>Subscribe to our newsletter</h3><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout__content\"><p>Stay up to date with all the latest cinema news, including updates, membership news and more.</p></div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__form__wrapper\"><a href=\"/newsletter-signup/\">Your email address...</a></div></div><div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__privacy__wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/privacy-policy/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"1048\">Read privacy policy</a></div></div></div></section>\t\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n  <div id=\"inner-footer\" class=\"wrap cf\">\n    <div id=\"media_image-4\" class=\"widget-odd widget-first widget-1 logo-footer widget widget_media_image\"><h4 class=\"widgettitle\">The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema</h4><a href=\"/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png\" class=\"image wp-image-1947  attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/upl