o.uk/sign-in/\"><i class=\"far fa-user-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Sign in</span></a></li>\n</ul></div></div>    </div>\n  </section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"content\">\n\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"film-details\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"film-details__image__container\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"film-details__image\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/film_images/436886.d.jpg?cb=1741024933\" alt=\"Image for French Impressions: Oh My Goodness! (Juste Ciel!)\"><div class=\"film-details__image__overlay\"></div></div><div class=\"film-details__inner alignwide\"><div class=\"film-details__top\"><div class=\"film-details__top__left\"><h3>Browse</h3><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/shrek-forever-after/\" class=\"film-details__browse-previous\" title=\"Previous\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-left\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/films/rbo-die-walkure/\" class=\"film-details__browse-next\" title=\"Next\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-right\"></i></a></div><div class=\"film-details__top__content\"><h1 class=\"film-details__title\">French Impressions: Oh My Goodness! (Juste Ciel!)<span class=\"film-details__rating\">12A</span></h1><div class=\"film-details__buttons chiswick-buttons\"><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-primary\" href=\"#book\"><i class=\"fal fa-chevron-down\"></i><span>Book Tickets</span></a><a class=\"chiswick-button btn-secondary\" data-lity=\"1\" data-action=\"play-trailer\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=urVFLOiDepg\"><i class=\"fal fa-play\"></i><span>Play Trailer</span></a></div><div class=\"film-details__synopsis\">French Film expert Jon Davies hosts an informative and entertaining pre-film lecture before a hand-picked French film release in our new monthly club. The introduction lasts around sixty minutes, followed by a short break for refreshments followed by the film screening. French Impressions joins us from the Waterman&#8217;s Arts Centre, where Jon hosted it for over twenty years, with their kind consent. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout Oh My Goodness:<br />\r\nWhen the local nursing home finds itself in dire straits and in danger of falling to pieces, it’s down to Mother Veronique (Valérie Bonneton) and the five eccentric sisters of the convent of St. Benedict to find a way to help.<br />\n<br />\nSpotting a poster for a bike race with a €25,000 cash prize (and the incentive of a trip to the Vatican for the winner!), the sisters might just have their answer. The only drawbacks are that they are terrible cyclists, and their rival convent, led by Mother Veronique’s childhood rival Mother Josephine (Sidse Babett Knudsen), have their own plans for the prize money – and just a little more experience…but God works in mysterious ways!<br />\n<br />\nFun and frothy, Laurent Tirard’s hilariously absurd comedy will have you rolling in the aisles, and the stunning landscapes of France’s Jura region provide a beautiful backdrop too!</div><div class=\"film-details__cast\"><h3 class=\"film-details__cast__header\">Cast</h3><div class=\"film-details__cast__list\">Sidse Babett Knudsen • François Morel • Camille Chamoux • Valérie Bonneton • Guilaine Londez</div></div><div class=\"film-details__director-runtime\"><div class=\"film-details__director\"><h3 class=\"film-details__director__header\">Director</h3><div class=\"film-details__director__list\">Laurent Tirard</div></div><div class=\"film-details__running-time\"><h3 class=\"film-details__running-time__header\">Running Time</h3><div class=\"film-details__running-time__content\">87 minutes\n                            </div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__rating-description\"><div class=\"film-details__rating-description__content\">infrequent strong language, moderate injury detail, drug references</div></div></div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets\" id=\"book\"><h2 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__title\">Book Tickets</h2><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__inner\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__intro__content\">Platinum Members get priority booking &#8211; please <a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/sign-in/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"615\">sign in</a> to access. <br><br>Public booking opens every Tuesday for the subsequent Friday to Thursday.</div></div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content\"><h3 class=\"film-details__book-tickets__content__title\">French Impressions: Oh My Goodness! (Juste Ciel!)<span class=\"film-details__rating\">12A</span></h3><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day\"><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__label\">Sat 10 May</div><div class=\"film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day__times\"><div class=\"book__link__wrap\"><a class=\"book__link\" data-time=\"13:00\" data-id=\"436887\" href=\"/tickets/436887\"><span>13:00</span><span data-tag=\"Ad Free\">Ad Free</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><script>\n                                jQuery(function($) {\n\n                                    var items = [];\n                                    var idx = 1;\n                                    var title = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__title')[0].textContent;\n                                    var days = document.getElementsByClassName('film-details__book-tickets__schedule__day');\n                                    for(var i=0;i<days.length;i++) {\n                                        var day = days[i];\n                                        var screenings = day.getElementsByClassName('book__link');\n                                        for(var screeningIdx=0;screeningIdx<screenings.length;screeningIdx++) {\n                                            var screening = screenings[screeningIdx];\n                                            var tags = screening.getElementsByTagName('span');\n                                            var ic = [];\n                                            for(var tagIndex=1;tagIndex<tags.length;tagIndex++) {\n                                                ic.push(tags[tagIndex].textContent);\n                                            }\n                                            items.push({\n                                                item_id:screening.getAttribute('data-id'),\n                                                item_name:title,\n                                                index:idx++,\n                                                item_category:screening.getAttribute('data-time'),\n                                                item_category2:ic.join('|'),\n                                                item_category4:screening.title?screening.title:undefined\n                                            });\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                    window.dataLayer.push({\n                                        event:'view_item_list',\n                                        ecommerce:{\n                                            items:items\n                                        }\n                                    });\n                                })\n                            </script></div></div></div></div> \n\n<section class=\"chiswick__newsletter\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Newsletter-Desktop-BG2.jpg)\" data-align=\"full\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__inner\"><h3>Subscribe to our newsletter</h3><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout\"><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__layout__content\"><p>Stay up to date with all the latest cinema news, including updates, membership news and more.</p></div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__form__wrapper\"><a href=\"/newsletter-signup/\">Your email address...</a></div></div><div><div class=\"chiswick__newsletter__privacy__wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/privacy-policy/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"1048\">Read privacy policy</a></div></div></div></section>\t\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n  <div id=\"inner-footer\" class=\"wrap cf\">\n    <div id=\"media_image-4\" class=\"widget-odd widget-first widget-1 logo-footer widget widget_media_image\"><h4 class=\"widgettitle\">The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema</h4><a href=\"/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"83\" src=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png\" class=\"image wp-image-1947  attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"The Chiswick Cinema – a Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-300x83.png 300w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1024x282.png 1024w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-768x212.png 768w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1600x441.png 1600w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-1536x424.png 1536w, https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/TCC_Logo_White-2048x565.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></div><div id=\"nav_menu-3\" class=\"widget-even widget-2 widget widget_nav_menu\"><div class=\"menu-footer-left-container\"><ul id=\"menu-footer-left\" class=\"menu\"><li id=\"menu-item-1045\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1045\"><a href=\"https://www.chiswickcinema.co.uk/gift-membership/\">Gift membership</a></li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-1046\" class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1046\"><a href=\"https: