Cinema\"><i class=\"fab fa-twitter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Twitter</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-624\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/thechiswickcinema/\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span>Facebook</span></a></li>\n</ul></div></div>  </div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"footer-copyright\" role=\"contentinfo\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n  <div class=\"footer-copyright__inner wrap cf\">\n    <div id=\"text-2\" class=\"widget-odd widget-first widget-1 widget widget_text\">\t\t\t<div class=\"textwidget\"><p>©2023 The Chiswick Cinema, all rights reserved. The Chiswick Cinema &#8211; a <a href=\"https://www.trafalgarentertainment.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trafalgar Entertainment Cinema</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div><div id=\"custom_html-2\" class=\"widget_text widget-even widget-last widget-2 widget widget_custom_html\"><div class=\"textwidget custom-html-widget\"><style>  \r\n\t.header .header-top {\r\n\t\tpadding-top: 35px;\r\n\t\tpadding-bottom: 35px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t.gift-section {\r\n\t\tborder-color: #555;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.gift-section .react-button.btn-large {\r\n\t\tmin-width: auto;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.chiswick__membership-types__list {\r\n \t grid-gap: 30px;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t@media only screen and (min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 767px) {\r\n          div.eedee-gutenslider-pagination.swiper-pagination-clickable.swiper-pagination-bullets {\r\n            bottom: -5px;\r\n            text-align: left;\r\n          }\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.static-content-child__title {\r\n\t\tline-height:normal;\r\n\t}\t\r\n     .static-content-child__title a {\r\n      text-decoration: none !important;\r\n    }\r\n\t\r\n\t.whats-on .title-bar__title {\r\n    margin-top: 15px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t.filter-bar .chiswick-button.btn-filter {\r\n\t\tfont-weight: normal;\r\n    font-size: 90%;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n.tickets__tickets-select__memb